   119	def edit_guard(original, proposal):
   120	    """Return rejection reasons; unchanged unsupported characters are preserved.
   121	
   122	    Greek bases and legal mark multiplicities are the only editable letters.
   123	    Non-Greek clusters and unsupported Greek clusters must remain identical.
   124	    Canonical equivalence alone is never a reason to rewrite source bytes.
